    "detailed_description": "&quot;Why Me&quot; -&gt; Climb -&gt; Die -&gt; Curse developers -&gt; Repeat.<br><br>You are stuck on a strange rock in the middle of the ocean, the only way out is to go up.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Know your Eye-Hand coordination level.<br></li><li>Beware of deadly traps.<br></li><li>Play Permanent death mode to set fastest run time.<br></li><li>Or just take it easy with checkpoints (no timer).<br></li><li>Try to keep a low death count.<br></li><li>You know you can do a better run each time you fall or die.<br></li><li>Test you patience.<br></li><li>Set Global Record<br><br>This is not just another climb game.<br>So, be ready to experience progressive difficulty as you move up.<br><br><br>You play the character of Nolan, who is stuck on a strange rock in the middle of the ocean.<br><br>There is no escape, the ocean is vast and full of dangerous creatures.<br><br>Above you is a way full of hard to navigate objects and deadly traps, perhaps it is a playbox created by some higher dimensional creature who created this to get rid of his boredom and watch you try.<br><br>The strange thing is Death is just a count here, no matter how you die, you spawn back at the bottom of rock.<br><br>Please use the discord link to directly connect with the developer and drop your feedback about game, any bug report or suggestions.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Why Me&quot; -&gt; Climb -&gt; Die -&gt; Curse developers -&gt; Repeat.<br><br>You are stuck on a strange rock in the middle of the ocean, the only way out is to go up.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Know your Eye-Hand coordination level.<br></li><li>Beware of deadly traps.<br></li><li>Play Permanent death mode to set fastest run time.<br></li><li>Or just take it easy with checkpoints (no timer).<br></li><li>Try to keep a low death count.<br></li><li>You know you can do a better run each time you fall or die.<br></li><li>Test you patience.<br></li><li>Set Global Record<br><br>This is not just another climb game.<br>So, be ready to experience progressive difficulty as you move up.<br><br><br>You play the character of Nolan, who is stuck on a strange rock in the middle of the ocean.<br><br>There is no escape, the ocean is vast and full of dangerous creatures.<br><br>Above you is a way full of hard to navigate objects and deadly traps, perhaps it is a playbox created by some higher dimensional creature who created this to get rid of his boredom and watch you try.<br><br>The strange thing is Death is just a count here, no matter how you die, you spawn back at the bottom of rock.<br><br>Please use the discord link to directly connect with the developer and drop your feedback about game, any bug report or suggestions.</li></ul>",
